# 统一用 LF 入库，避免 Windows 上 checkout 后整仓变成 CRLF、产生无意义的 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不要做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp3 binary
*.m4a binary
*.wav binary
*.flac binary
*.ogg binary
*.zip binary

# GitHub 语言统计：把 HTML/CSS 归到前端、Python 归到后端，剩下的当文档
*.html linguist-detectable=true
*.css  linguist-detectable=true
*.py   linguist-detectable=true
*.md   linguist-documentation
docs/img/* linguist-documentation
